  "sourceTitle": "Virginia Waffles",
  "sourceText": "Virginia Waffles\nBy: Kitch-N-Chik\nPublished: Saturday, December 12, 2009 - 12:25am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup boiling water\n1/4 tablespoon baking powder\n1/2 cup white corn meal\n1/2 teaspoon salt\n1/2 cup milk\n2 Egg yolks\n3 cups flour\n2 egg whites\n3 Tablespoons sugar\n2 Tablespoons melted butter\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook meal in boiling water twenty minutes; add milk, dry ingredients mixed and sifted, yolks of eggs well beaten, butter, and whites of eggs beaten stiff. Cook same as Waffles.",
